description: Repository agent rules — source of truth is AGENTS.md
alwaysApply: true
---

The single source of truth for how to work in this repository is **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root.
Read it first and follow it for every task. This rule does not restate or override it.

See also:
- `@AGENTS.md`
- Living spec: `.agent/spec/` (one living spec — do not create a folder per feature)
- Reuse inventory: `.agent/capabilities.md`
- Learning log: `.agent/learnings.md`
- Standards: `.agent/standards/` (apply a language standard only to that language's files)
